", "title": "为什么要存这笔钱", "title_en": "Why Save For Education", "blueprint": "saving-for-education", "why": "RDRE 第 1 章决定你上岗后第一句话怎么说：先分清「规则」与「统计」，才不会把过期数字讲成现行事实。", "n": 21, "checks": 5, "minutes": 14, "lesson": "saving-for-education", "chapter": "RDRE ch01"}, {"id": "scholarship-plan-mechanics", "title": "集团奖学金计划怎么运转", "title_en": "How Group Scholarship Plans Work", "blueprint": "scholarship-plans", "why": "奖学金计划这一簇（第 5–8 章）在 RDRE 卷面占 23 分权重，是全卷第二大板块，第 5 章本身是这一簇的地基。", "n": 30, "checks": 7, "minutes": 24, "lesson": "scholarship-plan-mechanics", "chapter": "RDRE ch05"}]